ndex  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229739,"global_rank":113121},{"name":"floatedbloom/PhizzyAI","owner":"floatedbloom","html_url":"https://github.com/floatedbloom/PhizzyAI","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"OSS4AI May Hackathon Winning Submission","topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113123},{"name":"goelmedha1/VoiceBot","owner":"goelmedha1","html_url":"https://github.com/goelmedha1/VoiceBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113138},{"name":"Kaia15/tensorpy","owner":"Kaia15","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaia15/tensorpy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A numerical computing library in pure Python from scratch by implementing 15+ NumPy-equivalent functions including multi-dimensional array operations, linear algebra, broadcasting logic & polynomial operations","topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113148},{"name":"9999years/nix-remote","owner":"9999years","html_url":"https://github.com/9999years/nix-remote","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113149},{"name":"denshoproject/namesdb","owner":"denshoproject","html_url":"https://github.com/denshoproject/namesdb","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229735,"global_rank":113154},{"name":"leozc/zTalkbot","owner":"leozc","html_url":"https://github.com/leozc/zTalkbot","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Py